# This file is linked from the repository root as `.dockerignore` (the build
# toolchain only honors `.dockerignore` at the build-context root, which is the
# repo root). Edit it here; keep the root symlink in place.
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.local-run
**/*.log
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tar.gz.tmp
**/*.tar.zst
# runtime data bind mount (docker/data) - never part of the image
docker/data
